    "Each comparison is an isolated process; QApplication/imports precede its memray Tracker.",
    "Memray peaks are live tracked allocations including Python allocators and native allocations, not total process RSS.",
    "Every scenario includes cold installed-mod discovery and SQLite cache population, except explicitly warm metadata.",
    "QImage and QPixmap are both retained; shared backing storage is not counted twice in image payloads.",
    "PNG setScaledSize bounds the retained bitmap but the PNG codec can still allocate full-resolution scratch space.",
    "WebP is encoded at quality 80, bounded to 600x338, and decoded for display; compressed bytes are not decoded RAM.",
    "Grid is a controlled QWidget + two QLabel experiment, not the production QML ListView; images cycle across the real preview corpus.",
    "Virtual grid visits every row but retains at most 24 delegates; nonvirtual retains every row. Missing previews use real corpus images for equal workload.",
    "Breakdown classifies peak stacks: sqlite3 native frames; image decode/load/pixmap conversion frames; card creation frames; Python allocator records; other.",
